Package: mainger
Title: Mahalanobis-Integrated Regression Under Privacy Constraints
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Anonymous", "Author", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "anonymous@example.com"))
Description: A unified framework for integrating external summary statistics into
    internal regression models under three data-sharing scenarios (full, partial,
    restricted). Provides closed-form estimators, theoretical bounds on the
    beneficial tuning range, data-adaptive tuning via cross-validation and
    extended AIC, and diagnostics for assessing the privacy-precision trade-off.
